{"title":"Blending In","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/blending-in","date":1758134899000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1844\" alt=\"illustration of a woman whose swirly dress pattern is matched by the background\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"illustration of a woman wearing a black &amp; white striped dress that blends into the background\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sofia-bonati-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1569\" alt=\"illustration of a woman in a colorful patterned dress that blends into the background\" /></p>\n\n<p>These are some of my favorite portrait illustrations <a href=\"https://www.sofiabonati.com/\">from Sofia Bonati</a>.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>In her art you’ll find female portraits that invite you into a dreamlike world where the woman and her surroundings intertwine, connect. They are women with deep, mysterious looks, who want to tell us something.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>I especially like the more geometric ones that radiate. Prints and original works are available <a href=\"https://www.sofiabonati.com/products\">in her shop</a>. (via <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2025/07/sofia-bonati-hypnotic-characters/\">colossal</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/illustration\">illustration</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Sofia%20Bonati\">Sofia Bonati</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/blending-in\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"2b86e47ef532b69b3bbc58f6bc832346ebdb41a8c608056c32be94b5745e3742","category":"Sites"}